{
  "zhTitle": "Details and history",
  "summary": "Canton 参考文档：Details and history。",
  "body": "> JSON Ledger API OpenAPI 端点详细信息和版本历史记录。\n\n<div class=\"x2mdx-ref-hero\">\n  <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-eyebrow\">OpenAPI 参考</p>\n\n  <h1 class=\"x2mdx-ref-title\">详细信息和历史记录</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-summary\">JSON Ledger API OpenAPI 表面的端点概述，根据版本化版本快照构建。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n    <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">OpenAPI</span>\n\n    <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--neutral\">3.5</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>发布版本</dt>\n      <dd>3.5</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>来源</dt>\n      <dd>Canton 发布捆绑包 JSON Ledger API 规范</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>版本过滤器</dt>\n      <dd>3.4, 3.5</dd>\n    </div>\n  </dl>\n</div>\n\n## 端点\n\n从侧边栏中选择 OpenAPI 操作以获取请求和响应详细信息。本页总结了已配置的 Ledger API 版本中端点生命周期的变化。\n\n<div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-grid\">\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/commands/提交并等待</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">POST：提交单个复合命令并等待其结果。传播失败提交的 gRPC 错误，包括 Daml 解释错误。</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>发布</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/commands/提交并等待交易</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">POST：提交单个复合命令，等待其结果，然后返回交易。传播失败提交的 gRPC 错误，包括 Daml 解释错误。</p><dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>发布</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/commands/提交并等待重新分配</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">POST：提交单个复合重新分配命令，等待其结果，然后返回重新分配。传播提交失败的 gRPC 错误。</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>发布</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/commands/submit-and-wait-for-transaction-tree</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--removed\">已弃用</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">POST：提交一批命令并等待事务树响应。为向后兼容而提供，在Canton 3.5.0版本中将被删除，使用submit-and-wait-for...</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>发布</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/commands/async/submit</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">POST：提交单个复合命令。</p><dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>发布</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/commands/async/提交重新分配</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">POST：提交单个重新分配。</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>发布</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/命令/完成</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">POST：查询完成列表（阻塞调用）订阅命令完成事件。注意：此端点应用于小结果集。当结果数量超出节点配置时...</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>发布</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/events/events-by-contract-id</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">POST：获取具有提供的 ID 的合约的创建和消费行使事件。对于已被修剪的合约，不会返回任何事件，因为它们已经被...</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>发布</dd>\n      </div><div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/版本</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">获取</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">GET：读取 Ledger API 版本</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>获取</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/dars/验证</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">POST：验证 DAR 并检查 DAR 软件包与目标审核同步器上已审核软件包集的升级兼容性。请参阅 ValidateDarFileReque...</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>发布</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/dars</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">POST：上传 DAR 到参与者节点</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>发布</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/包</h3><div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">获取、发布</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">GET：返回所有支持的包的标识符。 POST：行为与 /dars 相同。此端点将在未来版本中弃用并删除。将 DAR 文件上传到粒子...</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>获取、发布</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/packages/\\{package-id}</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">获取</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">GET：返回单个包的内容。</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>操作</dt>\n        <dd>获取</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>最后一次见到</dt>\n        <dd>3.5</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>/v2/packages/\\{package-id}/status</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">获取</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4 起</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--changed\">更改为 3.5</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">GET：返回单个